            <div class="platform-grid"><section class="platform-card"><header><h3>平台分派 <small>策略 → 实现</small></h3></header><div class="platform-tabs"><button v-for="item in platformOptions" :key="item.id" :class="{ active: platform === item.id }" @click="platform = item.id">{{ item.label }}</button></div><div class="implementation-code"><code>sandbox_policy = {<br>&nbsp; level: '{{ activeLevel.id }} · {{ activeLevel.name }}',<br>&nbsp; platform: '{{ activePlatform.id }}',<br>&nbsp; impl: '{{ activePlatform.implementation }}',<br>&nbsp; max_level: '{{ levels[activePlatform.maxLevel - 1].name }}'<br>}</code></div><p class="platform-note">本平台上限 <b>{{ levels[activePlatform.maxLevel - 1].name }}</b> · 当前策略 <b :class="supportLabel === '可用' ? 'supported' : 'not-supported'">{{ supportLabel }}</b></p></section>
              <section class="coverage-card"><header><h3>层级 × 维度覆盖</h3><small>只有 ✓ 才是真实隔离</small></header><div class="coverage-table"><div class="coverage-row coverage-head"><span>层级</span><span>文件</span><span>网络</span><span>PID</span><span>凭据</span><span>资源</span><span>启动</span></div><div v-for="(row, index) in layerMatrix" :key="row[0]" class="coverage-row" :class="{ current: selectedLevel === index + 1 }" @click="chooseLevel(levels[index])"><span>{{ row[0] }}</span><span>{{ row[1] }}</span><span>{{ row[2] }}</span><span>{{ row[3] }}</span><span>{{ row[4] }}</span><span>{{ row[5] }}</span><span>{{ row[6] }}</span></div></div><p class="coverage-foot">当前组合覆盖 <b>{{ activeLevel.cover.filter(Boolean).length }}/5</b> 个维度 · {{ activeLevel.scene }}</p></section></div>
          </template>
          <template v-else>
            <section class="topic-detail"><div class="topic-title"><span><component :is="[ShieldCheck, ShieldCheck, Network, Cpu, ShieldCheck, ShieldCheck, Activity, ShieldCheck, SquareTerminal, Activity, Check][activeTopic]" :size="17" /></span><div><h2>{{ topic[0] }}</h2><p>{{ topic[1] }}</p></div></div><p class="topic-description">{{ topic[2] }}</p><div class="policy-fields"><div><small>当前沙箱</small><strong>{{ activeSandbox.id }}</strong></div><div><small>运行任务</small><strong>{{ activeSandbox.title }}</strong></div><div><small>平台</small><strong>{{ activePlatform.label }} · {{ activePlatform.implementation }}</strong></div><div><small>策略档位</small><strong>{{ activeLevel.id }} · {{ activeLevel.name }}</strong></div></div><div class="topic-checks"><div><Check :size="14" /><span><b>策略来源明确</b><small>绑定沙箱运行与策略版本</small></span></div><div><Check :size="14" /><span><b>运行时状态可见</b><small>未接入 API · 本地演示状态</small></span></div><div><AlertTriangle :size="14" /><span><b>变更会影响后续运行</b><small>策略修改能力尚未接入</small></span></div></div><button class="policy-action" @click="emit('notify', `${topic[0]}配置为本地演示，只读查看`)"><SquareTerminal :size="14" />查看策略配置</button></section>
          </template>
          <section class="isolation-rules"><header><h3>三条判断 <small>写进设计评审用</small></h3></header><ol><li>隔离层级选择“够用且可验证”的实现，高强度会增加启动成本。</li><li>策略语义与平台实现分离，平台不同也要保留相同的安全边界。</li><li>降级和不支持状态必须显式展示，不静默切换到更弱隔离。</li></ol></section>
        </div>
      </main>

      <aside class="effective-policy"><header><strong>生效隔离策略</strong><small>{{ activeSandbox.id }}</small></header><div class="effective-state"><span class="state-dot" :class="activeSandbox.status === '运行中' ? 'running' : activeSandbox.status === '已挂起' ? 'paused' : 'stopped'"></span><b>{{ activeSandbox.status }}</b><span>{{ supportLabel }}</span></div><h2>{{ activeSandbox.title }}</h2><p class="effective-agent">{{ activeSandbox.agent }} · {{ activeSandbox.status === '运行中' ? `已运行 ${activeSandbox.elapsed}` : activeSandbox.status }}</p><section class="effective-dimensions"><h3>五维生效值</h3><div><ShieldCheck :size="13" /><span>隔离层级</span><b>{{ activePlatform.label }} · {{ activeLevel.name }} · {{ activeLevel.boot }}</b></div><div><ShieldCheck :size="13" /><span>文件系统</span><b>{{ activeSandbox.workspace }} 可写 · .git 只读</b></div><div><Network :size="13" /><span>网络</span><b>{{ activeSandbox.network }}</b></div><div><Cpu :size="13" /><span>进程资源</span><b>{{ activeSandbox.cpu }} / {{ activeSandbox.memory }} / {{ activeSandbox.pids }} pids · 300s</b></div><div><ShieldCheck :size="13" /><span>凭据</span><b>{{ activeSandbox.credentials }}</b></div><div><Check :size="13" /><span>审批</span><b>{{ activeSandbox.approvals }} · 超时拒绝</b></div></section><section class="violation-summary"><div><small>越界尝试</small><strong>{{ activeSandbox.violations }}</strong></div><div><small>沙箱拒绝</small><strong>{{ activeSandbox.violations }}</strong></div><div><small>文件完整性</small><strong class="green-text">✓ 正常</strong></div></section><section class="policy-events"><h3>策略变更与拦截 <small>最近 1 条</small></h3><div><i></i><span><b>沙箱就绪 · {{ activeSandbox.id }} · 生效 {{ activeLevel.name }} · 五维策略已加载</b><small>02:14:36</small></span></div></section><button class="effective-help" @click="emit('notify', '当前为本地演示策略，不会启动真实沙箱')"><CircleHelp :size="14" />策略运行详情<ChevronRight :size="13" /></button></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</template>

